"Create a small Python project in the workspace with the following structure:\n\nproject/\n  calculator.py\n  test_calculator.py\n\ncalculator.py should contain a function `add(a, b)` that returns the sum of a and b.\n\ntest_calculator.py should contain a test function `test_add` that asserts `add(2, 3) == 5`.\n\nUse the `unittest` framework. After creating the files, run the test suite once with `python3 -m unittest discover -s project` and report the output."